{"code":"BL15","wikidata":"Q1036816","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Lom MRT station","th":"สถานีสีลม"},"summary":{"en":"Si Lom station is an underground station of the Bangkok MRT, on the Blue Line in Bangkok, Thailand. The station is located beneath Rama IV Road at Sala Daeng Intersection, where Si Lom Road begins, serving one of the city's main business districts.","th":"สถานีสีลม เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดิน ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่ถนนพระรามที่ 4 กรุงเทพมหานคร บริเวณสี่แยกศาลาแดง มีทำเลอยู่ใจกลางเมืองในย่านธุรกิจถนนสีลม"},"opened":"2005-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Sala_Daeng_BTS_Station_-_Si_Lom_MRT_Station_Connection_2021.jpg/960px-Sala_Daeng_BTS_Station_-_Si_Lom_MRT_Station_Connection_2021.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sala_Daeng_BTS_Station_-_Si_Lom_MRT_Station_Connection_2021.jpg","author":"Chainwit.","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/201701_Concourse_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Concourse_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Concourse_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/201701_Platform_1_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Platform_1_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Platform_1_of_Si_Lom_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/201701_Si_Lom%E2%80%93Sala_Daeng_Flyover.jpg/960px-201701_Si_Lom%E2%80%93Sala_Daeng_Flyover.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.w